    Scope group chat unseen counts to the current subscription window
    
    Three unread-count bugs around chats the user was removed from:
    
    - ListGroupChats and GetGroupChat counted messages sent after the
      viewer left the chat, which they can never open (the Ping badge
      correctly excluded them, so the counts disagreed)
    - rejoining a chat leaves the earlier subscription behind, and Ping
      matched on any of the viewer's subscriptions, so the stale one kept
      the badge up even after the viewer read everything
    - send_message_notifications matched on any subscription too, so it
      could email about messages already read on the current one, and
      quote a higher unseen count than the app showed
    
    Share the window, unseen and current-subscription rules in
    couchers.helpers.group_chats so all the counts agree.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

