    Fix web static file race condition in CI pipelines
    
    Concurrent pipelines on develop could overwrite each other's static files
    in S3, causing the wrong bundle to be served. This removes the non-atomic
    s3 rm + s3 cp pattern and the static.tar.gz redirect objects, instead
    relying on the uniquely-named files (static-{pipeline_id}-{sha}.tar.gz)
    directly. The deploy manifest now includes the exact static filename so
    deploy tooling can reference the correct file.
    
